t "9 V from the panel jack. D101 blocks reverse polarity, D102 and C101 tame the hot-plug transient
that locked the TLC5927s on v1. Two branches with their own polyfuse, so a fault on one leaves the other up:
+9V_BL feeds the backlight, +9V_REG the MIC29302. 5V_EXT goes to the TPS2115A (logic) and to the
annunciator anode switch." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "60d75a68-be29-4559-8e6a-089172499710")))
